# Unreal Engine 5: Building AAA Game Experiences

Unreal Engine 5 powers the most visually stunning games in the industry. This guide covers the fundamentals needed to create professional-quality game experiences.

## Why Unreal Engine 5?

- **Nanite**: Virtualized geometry for film-quality assets
- **Lumen**: Dynamic global illumination
- **MetaHumans**: Photorealistic digital humans
- **Industry Standard**: Used by major studios
- **Free to Use**: Until $1M revenue

## Project Setup

### Creating a Project

```cpp
// Project Structure
MyGame/
├── Config/           // Configuration files
├── Content/          // Assets (meshes, textures, etc.)
├── Source/           // C++ source code
│   └── MyGame/
│       ├── MyGame.h
│       ├── MyGame.cpp
│       ├── MyGameGameMode.h
│       └── MyGameGameMode.cpp
├── MyGame.uproject   // Project file
└── Binaries/         // Compiled code
```

