## Lighting with Lumen

### Setup

```
Project Settings > Rendering:
├── Global Illumination Method: Lumen
├── Reflection Method: Lumen
└── Software Ray Tracing: Enabled (for lower-end)

Directional Light:
├── Mobility: Movable
└── Cast Shadows: Enabled

Sky Light:
├── Mobility: Movable
├── Real Time Capture: Enabled
└── Source Type: SLS Captured Scene
```

### Performance Tips

```
// Lumen Quality Settings
r.Lumen.TraceMeshSDFs 1        // Enable mesh SDFs
r.Lumen.Reflections.Allow 1    // Enable reflections

// For interiors
Post Process Volume:
├── Lumen GI: Enabled
└── Final Gather Quality: Higher for quality
```

## Animation System

### Animation Blueprint

```
AnimGraph:

[State Machine]  →  [Output Pose]
      │
      ├── Idle
      │     └── Play Idle Animation
      │
      ├── Walk
      │     └── Play Walk Animation
      │
      └── Run
            └── Play Run Animation

Transition Rules:
- Idle → Walk: Speed > 10
- Walk → Run: Speed > 300
- Any → Idle: Speed < 10
```

### Blend Spaces

```
// 1D Blend Space (Speed)
Axis: Speed (0 - 600)
├── 0: Idle
├── 150: Walk
└── 600: Run

// 2D Blend Space (Direction + Speed)
Horizontal: Direction (-180 to 180)
Vertical: Speed (0 to 600)
```

